Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.11,0:00:06.15,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,526)\blur2}故事迎來結尾 我該怎麼作別
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.11,0:00:06.15,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,526)\blur2}終わりが来たら　なんて言おう
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.53,0:00:11.03,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,526)\blur2}只能說聲安慰 希望你不要難過
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.53,0:00:11.03,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,526)\blur2}どうせなら　ほら　哀しくない様に
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.08,0:00:17.08,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur2}依稀記得你的話語
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.08,0:00:17.08,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur2}いつかのあなたの言葉が
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.46,0:00:19.25,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}怎樣傷了我的心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.46,0:00:19.25,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}酷く刺さってる
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.25,0:00:25.59,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur2}卻仍會回味 那份溫存
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.25,0:00:25.59,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur2}温かく残ってる
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.22,0:00:35.89,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur2}以為自己會慢慢了解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.22,0:00:35.89,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur2}知れば知るだけでいいのに
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.89,0:00:38.60,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur2}殊不知是一路追尋
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:38.60,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur2}何かを求めてしまう
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.60,0:00:39.48,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:39.48,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}大丈夫
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.48,0:00:41.52,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur2}我只會留在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:41.52,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur2}どこにも行かないよ
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.52,0:00:43.94,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur2}也只能留在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:43.94,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)}{\blur2}どこにも行けないよ
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.94,0:00:48.57,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur2}我不想 也不願忘記你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:48.57,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur2}忘れないのに
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.07,0:00:54.16,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur2}卻為何 為何看著你遠去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.07,0:00:54.16,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur2}何故か遠くなる
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.49,0:01:00.16,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur2}你的身影 在我眼裡漂泊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:01:00.16,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur2}瞳の裏にいつも君は居る
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.16,0:01:05.13,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur2}永遠刻在心底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:05.13,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,500)\blur2}今も　ずっとそう
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.17,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\blur2}等到不久的將來
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.17,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\blur2}いつかね もう少しね
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.17,0:01:12.47,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\blur2}看見柔風 吹醒這個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.17,0:01:12.47,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\blur2}世界に優しい風が吹いたら
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.47,0:01:16.64,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\blur2}那場離別 如今能否續寫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.47,0:01:16.64,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\blur2}何か変わるのでしょうか
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.85,0:01:19.23,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\blur2\pos(1920,1376.8)}“我想回到我們的終點”
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.85,0:01:19.23,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\blur2\pos(1920,1476.8)}「帰りたい場所がある」
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.23,0:01:21.94,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\blur2}我們都是星辰的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.23,0:01:21.94,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\blur2}誰もがこの星の子孫
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.94,0:01:24.86,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\blur2}含著那份 珍藏的諾言
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:24.86,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\blur2}約束はね　大事にね
Dialogue: 1,0:01:24.86,0:01:27.98,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}讓它融化在心底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.86,0:01:27.98,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\blur2}温かく残ってる
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.73,0:01:29.99,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2\pos(1920,1688.8)}讓它融化在心底
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.73,0:01:29.99,OP-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\blur2\pos(1920,1788.8)}温かく残ってる
Dialogue: 2,0:22:20.03,0:22:22.45,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\bord8\blur3\1a&ff\fad(0,500)}所以 你不用擔心
Dialogue: 3,0:22:20.03,0:22:22.45,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}所以 你不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.03,0:22:22.45,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\bord6\blur3\1a&ff\fad(0,500)}So don't you worry
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.03,0:22:22.45,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}So don't you worry
